\" >3, Remember to turn on the lights during your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4, The game\u2019s rules do not apply to your real-world life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5, If you\u2019re caught in a dilemma, trust your instincts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If rules open pathways to the deeper layers of this world, what happens when they\u2019re broken?\u00a0 Between reality and illusion, will you still remember who you are?</h2>","developers":["HaiBin studio"],"drm_notice":"\u65e0<br>\u65e0 machine activation limit","ext_user_account_notice":"\u65e0 ","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952970/35fbe3e07b399917aea31df812803459a0963ecd/header.jpg?t=1757526429","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2952970/1164912408/e65c1a5139477ed30a09f977f6201b0bb8e60653/1757301042/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757302074","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2952970/1164912408/e65c1a5139477ed30a09f977f6201b0bb8e60653/1757301042/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757302074","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2952970/1164912408/e65c1a5139477ed30a09f977f6201b0bb8e60653/1757301042/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757302074","id":257194403,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194403/movie480.mp4?t=1757302074","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194403/movie_max.mp4?t=1757302074"},"name":"Offcial Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194403/31c1b23ac689906a6c6b989c8125f1857dd90cc0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757302074","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194403/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757302074","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25